## 📚 Master Thesis
**Design and Experimental Evaluation of a ROS-Based Social Robot for Multimodal Mood and Health Monitoring in Office Environments**  
Developed at **Tohoku University, Sendai, Japan (SmartRobotDesignLab)** and **University of Naples Federico II**.  

[📚 Thesis](https://github.com/FabAlert/FabAlert/blob/main/MSc_Thesis.pdf)

Key highlights:
- Built **SUNNY**, a ROS-based social robot for mood & health monitoring in office environments.
- Implemented **multimodal sensing** (FER, SER, thermal camera, mmWave radar).
- Developed **fusion strategies** and **interaction management** with GPT-based dialogue.
- Conducted **HRI experiments** and statistical evaluation of mood changes.

